		(text "DESIGN RATINGS / LIMITS\nAC outputs use G3MB-202P DC5 SSRs: 2 A max per output, AC load only. Datasheet load range is 75-264 VAC; 24 VAC use is intentionally out-of-datasheet/prototype-only.\nBoard current assumption: 1 oz copper, 1.5 mm AC tracks. Limit shared solenoid common bus to 3 A total continuous; each switched output and pump output to 2 A max.\nFusing required: SOL_L common fuse <= 3 A, each load must be externally protected for wiring/load. 5V fuse <= 1 A.\nClearance policy: AC_HIGH_CURRENT nets use 1.5 mm clearance. This is not certified mains insulation; final product needs EE/safety review for creepage/clearance, enclosure, pollution degree, and fuse breaking capacity.\nSSR drive: ESP32 GPIO drives NPN low-side transistor via 4.7k. Firmware must configure outputs LOW before enabling loads. Add hardware base pulldowns in next rev if outputs must remain off through reset/bootloader faults.\nLow-voltage IO: ESP32 GPIO only, 3.3 V logic, 12 mA max recommended per pin. Boiler probe divider is 10k/10k: probe input <= 5 V nominal, <= 6.6 V absolute to keep ADC <= 3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "72a6a75d-ae2b-4b9a-943d-d94a0bc6f9f8")
	)
